{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいかの胸元のポケットには\n大量の綿棒が入っています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今ここにショートケーキ、\nチョコレートケーキ、\nチーズケーキがあります。\n万理華はどのケーキをえらぶ？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"迷うけど～チーズケーキ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"韓国料理はよく食べますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか食べる機会がない><\nトッポギおいしい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この夏、てか夏じゃなくても\nメンバーたちとロケに行ってみたい\n場所ってあるかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいしいものいっぱい\n食べるロケ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華はじゃんけん強い?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"弱いーーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしたら強くなる⁇←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問はどうやって選んでるの？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近答えたことある質問以外を\n答えてます><すみません。\n質問回答より本文メインに\nなるようにしたいと思ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度の握手会、もちろん万理華の\nとこ沢山行くんだけど、\n会話詰まったらどうしたらいい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー...笑っててー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オススメのブランドとかある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"santamonica、\nPar Avion、BEAMSBOY、RNA\n...がすきです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『あちゃちゅむ』いつか着たい、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前に撮った"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Zeppでのライブが決まりました！\nすごく嬉しいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13日 Zepp Namba\n14日 Zepp Nagoya"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公演に向けてリハ頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーキクラゲおいしいーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むしゃむしゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がうっち"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさいっち"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/3550421/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}